  "note": "Fully automated proxy metrics -- no human scoring. Context Relevance is exact (deterministic chunk-ID overlap). Faithfulness uses number-overlap against retrieved context, with Arabic/Khmer digit + Khmer number-word normalisation and list-ordinal exclusion to avoid false fabrication flags. Answer Correctness uses BGE-M3 cosine similarity vs the gold expected_answer (see docs/SCORING_CALIBRATION.md). Answer Relevance (answer-vs-question cosine) is computed for traceability but is NOT weighted -- it is structurally capped and penalised even gold-identical answers. Completeness checks sentence-final punctuation and a length-ratio FLOOR only (no over-length ceiling -- verbosity is not incompleteness). BLANK ANSWERS score 1 on Answer Correctness (not excluded from averages). weighted_combined is normalised by the sum of weights that had values -- None is reserved for genuinely uncomputable metrics (missing expected_answer), not for blank generated answers. The winning model is the one the live chatbot and scripts/18_evaluate_safety_gates.py run on."
}